      "value": "Just as a hint:\nIn order for VRC staff to do anything about it, they need as much info about it as possible.\nWithout providing anything, they are most likely not able to do anything about it.\nYou should add information like:\n- How often does this happen\n- When does this happen\n- Screenshots (if possible)\n- Information about your system, that might be relevant\n- Last things you did in VR chat might have crashed VRC\n- everything else, that you can provide",
